 "convocatoria": "Septiembre",
 "documento": "MAT-2016-SEPTIEMBRE.pdf",
 "ejercicios": [
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2016-septiembre-1",
   "n": 1,
   "num": 1,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sabiendo que \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to0}\\left(\\frac1{e^x-1}-\\frac m{2x}\\right)\\) es finito, calcula \\(m\\) y el valor del límite.",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Es una indeterminación \\(\\infty-\\infty\\). Opero:</p>\\[\\lim_{x\\to0}\\left(\\frac1{e^x-1}-\\frac m{2x}\\right)=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{2x-m(e^x-1)}{2x(e^x-1)}=\\left[\\frac00\\right]\\overset{\\text{L'H}}=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{2-me^x}{2(e^x-1)+2xe^x}\\]<p>(He aplicado la regla de L'Hôpital<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de L'Hôpital: si el límite de \\(\\frac fg\\) da \\(\\frac00\\) o \\(\\frac\\infty\\infty\\), es igual al límite de \\(\\frac{f'}{g'}\\), si este existe.</i>.) El denominador tiende a 0 y el numerador a \\(2-m\\). Si \\(2-m\\neq0\\), el límite sería infinito<i class='n' data-t='why'>Un número distinto de cero dividido entre algo que tiende a 0 da infinito.</i>; para que sea finito, \\(\\boxed{m=2}\\).</p><p>Con \\(m=2\\) vuelve a ser \\(\\frac00\\):</p>\\[\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{2-2e^x}{2e^x-2+2xe^x}\\overset{\\text{L'H}}=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{-2e^x}{2e^x+2e^x+2xe^x}=\\frac{-2}{4}=-\\frac12\\]<div class='res'>\\(m=2\\) y el límite vale \\(-\\dfrac12\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "funciones",
     "tipo": "lim",
     "apartados": ""
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": "MAT-2016-SEPTIEMBRE.pdf"
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
   "revision": "borrador"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2016-septiembre-2",
   "n": 2,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) la función definida por \\(f(x)=x^4\\). Encuentra la recta horizontal que corta a la gráfica de \\(f\\) formando con ella un recinto con área \\(\\dfrac85\\).",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>La recta horizontal es \\(y=k\\), con \\(k\\gt0\\) (si no, no encierra recinto). Corta a \\(f\\) en \\(x^4=k\\iff x=\\pm a\\), con \\(a=\\sqrt[4]k\\), es decir, \\(k=a^4\\). El recinto queda entre \\(-a\\) y \\(a\\), con la recta por encima:</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 200' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='68.8,81.0 72.8,81.0 76.9,81.0 80.9,81.0 85.0,81.0 89.1,81.0 93.1,81.0 97.2,81.0 101.2,81.0 105.3,81.0 109.4,81.0 113.4,81.0 117.5,81.0 121.6,81.0 125.6,81.0 129.7,81.0 133.8,81.0 137.8,81.0 141.9,81.0 145.9,81.0 150.0,81.0 154.1,81.0 158.1,81.0 162.2,81.0 166.2,81.0 170.3,81.0 174.4,81.0 178.4,81.0 182.5,81.0 186.6,81.0 190.6,81.0 194.7,81.0 198.8,81.0 202.8,81.0 206.9,81.0 210.9,81.0 215.0,81.0 219.1,81.0 223.1,81.0 227.2,81.0 231.2,81.0 231.2,81.0 227.2,95.1 223.1,107.2 219.1,117.4 215.0,125.9 210.9,133.0 206.9,138.8 202.8,143.5 198.8,147.3 194.7,150.2 190.6,152.4 186.6,154.0 182.5,155.2 178.4,156.0 174.4,156.5 170.3,156.8 166.2,157.0 162.2,157.1 158.1,157.1 154.1,157.1 150.0,157.1 145.9,157.1 141.9,157.1 137.8,157.1 133.8,157.0 129.7,156.8 125.6,156.5 121.6,156.0 117.5,155.2 113.4,154.0 109.4,152.4 105.3,150.2 101.2,147.3 97.2,143.5 93.1,138.8 89.1,133.0 85.0,125.9 80.9,117.4 76.9,107.2 72.8,95.1 68.8,81.0' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='54.1,9.4 57.3,28.2 60.5,45.1 63.7,60.2 66.9,73.8 70.1,85.9 73.3,96.6 76.5,106.1 79.7,114.4 82.9,121.7 86.1,128.0 89.3,133.4 92.5,138.0 95.7,141.9 98.9,145.2 102.1,147.9 105.3,150.1 108.5,151.9 111.7,153.4 114.8,154.5 118.0,155.3 121.2,155.9 124.4,156.4 127.6,156.7 130.8,156.9 134.0,157.0 137.2,157.1 140.4,157.1 143.6,157.1 146.8,157.1 150.0,157.1 153.2,157.1 156.4,157.1 159.6,157.1 162.8,157.1 166.0,157.0 169.2,156.9 172.4,156.7 175.6,156.4 178.8,155.9 182.0,155.3 185.2,154.5 188.3,153.4 191.5,151.9 194.7,150.1 197.9,147.9 201.1,145.2 204.3,141.9 207.5,138.0 210.7,133.4 213.9,128.0 217.1,121.7 220.3,114.4 223.5,106.1 226.7,96.6 229.9,85.9 233.1,73.8 236.3,60.2 239.5,45.1 242.7,28.2 245.9,9.4' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='20.0,81.0 106.7,81.0 193.3,81.0 280.0,81.0' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='68.8' cy='81.0' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='24.8' y='75.0'>(−a, k)</text><circle cx='231.2' cy='81.0' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='235.2' y='75.0'>(a, k)</text><text x='247.5' y='27.6' fill='#2f6df0' font-size='10'>f(x) = x⁴</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 157.1H294.0M150.0 194.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='68.8' y1='154.1' x2='68.8' y2='160.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='65.8' y='171.1' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='231.2' y1='154.1' x2='231.2' y2='160.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='228.2' y='171.1' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='147.0' y1='81.0' x2='153.0' y2='81.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='85.0' font-size='10'>1</text></svg></div><p>Por la simetría respecto de \\(OY\\):</p>\\[A=2\\int_0^a(a^4-x^4)\\,dx=2\\Bigl[a^4x-\\frac{x^5}5\\Bigr]_0^a=2\\left(a^5-\\frac{a^5}5\\right)=\\frac{8a^5}5\\]\\[\\frac{8a^5}5=\\frac85\\iff a^5=1\\iff a=1\\Rightarrow k=1\\]<div class='res'>La recta es \\(y=1\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
