  {
   "id": "matematicas-2016-septiembre-3",
   "n": 3,
   "num": 3,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera el siguiente sistema de ecuaciones lineales \\[\\begin{cases}2x-4y+2z=1\\\\5x-11y+9z=\\lambda\\\\x-3y+5z=2\\end{cases}\\]",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,75 p.) Discute el sistema según los valores de \\(\\lambda\\).",
     "(0,75 p.) Resuélvelo, si es posible, para \\(\\lambda=4\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[A=\\begin{pmatrix}2&-4&2\\\\5&-11&9\\\\1&-3&5\\end{pmatrix}\\qquad A^*=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc|c}2&-4&2&1\\\\5&-11&9&\\lambda\\\\1&-3&5&2\\end{array}\\right)\\]<p>Uso el teorema de Rouché-Frobenius<i class='n' data-t='th'>Rouché-Frobenius: el sistema es compatible si y solo si \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*\\); determinado si ese rango es el número de incógnitas, indeterminado si es menor.</i>. Calculo \\(|A|\\) por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}2&-4&2\\\\5&-11&9\\\\1&-3&5\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(-110-36-30\\bigr)-\\bigl(-22-54-100\\bigr)\\]\\[=0\\]<p>El menor \\(\\begin{vmatrix}2&-4\\\\1&-3\\end{vmatrix}=-6+4=-2\\neq0\\) (filas 1 y 3): \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=2\\) para todo \\(\\lambda\\). Menor de \\(A^*\\) de las columnas 1, 2 y 4:</p>\\[\\begin{vmatrix}2&-4&1\\\\5&-11&\\lambda\\\\1&-3&2\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(-44- 4 \\lambda-15\\bigr)-\\bigl(-11- 6 \\lambda-40\\bigr)\\]\\[=2\\lambda-8\\]\\[2\\lambda-8=0\\iff\\boxed{\\lambda=4}\\]<p><b>• Si </b>\\(\\lambda\\neq4\\)<b>:</b> \\(\\operatorname{rg}A^*=3\\neq\\operatorname{rg}A=2\\). <b>Sistema incompatible.</b></p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(\\lambda=4\\)<b>:</b> todos los menores de orden 3 de \\(A^*\\) que contienen al menor no nulo se anulan: \\(\\operatorname{rg}A^*=2=\\operatorname{rg}A\\lt3\\). <b>Sistema compatible indeterminado.</b></p><div class='res'>Si \\(\\lambda=4\\): compatible indeterminado. Si \\(\\lambda\\neq4\\): incompatible</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Con \\(\\lambda=4\\) me quedo con las ecuaciones 1 y 3 (contienen el menor no nulo) y elimino la 2.ª, que depende de ellas. Tomo \\(z=t\\):</p>\\[\\begin{cases}2x-4y=1-2t\\\\x-3y=2-5t\\end{cases}\\]<p>De la segunda, \\(x=2-5t+3y\\). Sustituyo en la primera: \\(4-10t+6y-4y=1-2t\\iff y=4t-\\frac32\\). Entonces \\(x=2-5t+12t-\\frac92=7t-\\frac52\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(x=-\\dfrac52+7t,\\ y=-\\dfrac32+4t,\\ z=t\\), con \\(t\\in\\mathbb R\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación con \\(t=0\\): \\(2\\left(-\\frac52\\right)-4\\left(-\\frac32\\right)=1\\) ✓; \\(5\\left(-\\frac52\\right)-11\\left(-\\frac32\\right)=4\\) ✓; \\(-\\frac52+\\frac92=2\\) ✓.</i></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "sistemas",
     "tipo": "disc",
     "apartados": "a"
    },
    {
     "tema": "sistemas",
     "tipo": "res",
     "apartados": "b"
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": "MAT-2016-SEPTIEMBRE.pdf"
   },
   "dificultad": null,
