  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2016-septiembre-4",
   "n": 4,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera el punto \\(A(1,-1,1)\\) y la recta \\(r\\) dada por \\(\\begin{cases}x=1+2\\lambda\\\\y=1-\\lambda\\\\z=1\\end{cases}\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,5 p.) Calcula las coordenadas del punto simétrico de \\(A\\) respecto a \\(r\\).",
     "(1 p.) Determina la ecuación del plano que contiene a \\(r\\) y pasa por \\(A\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(r\\) pasa por \\(R(1,1,1)\\) con \\(\\vec d=(2,-1,0)\\).</p><p><b>Paso 1. Plano perpendicular a la recta por el punto.</b> Como el plano \\(\\pi_\\perp\\) y la recta \\(r\\) son perpendiculares, el vector director de la recta es paralelo al vector normal del plano<i class='n' data-t='why'>Si el plano es perpendicular a la recta, el vector director de la recta es paralelo al normal del plano; por eso los coeficientes de \\(x\\), \\(y\\), \\(z\\) son las componentes de \\(\\vec d\\).</i>. Con \\(\\vec d=(2,\\ -1,\\ 0)\\), el plano es de la forma</p>\\[\\pi_\\perp\\equiv 2x-y+D=0\\]<p>Como contiene al punto \\(A(1,\\ -1,\\ 1)\\): \\(2\\cdot1-(-1)+D=0\\iff D=-3\\).</p>\\[\\pi_\\perp\\equiv 2x-y-3=0\\]<p><b>Paso 2. Punto de corte.</b> Sustituyo las paramétricas de \\(r\\) en \\(\\pi_\\perp\\):</p>\\[2(1+2\\lambda)-(1-\\lambda)-3=0\\iff 5\\lambda-2=0\\iff \\lambda=\\frac{2}{5}\\]\\[M\\left(\\frac{9}{5},\\ \\frac{3}{5},\\ 1\\right)\\]<p><b>Paso 3. Punto medio.</b> \\(M\\) es el punto medio entre \\(A\\) y su simétrico \\(A'(a,b,c)\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>El simétrico \\(P'\\) cumple que \\(M\\) es el punto medio del segmento \\(PP'\\): cada coordenada de \\(M\\) es la media de las de \\(P\\) y \\(P'\\).</i>:</p>\\[\\frac{1+a}2=\\frac{9}{5},\\qquad\\frac{-1+b}2=\\frac{3}{5},\\qquad\\frac{1+c}2=1\\]\\[a=\\frac{13}{5},\\qquad b=\\frac{11}{5},\\qquad c=1\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":36,\"el\":15,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[3.047,3.094,2.0],[0.553,-1.894,2.0],[0.553,-1.894,0.0],[3.047,3.094,0.0]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[0.553,-1.894,0.0],\"π⊥\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[2.068,0.466,1.0],[1.934,0.198,1.0],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[1.934,0.198,1.0],[1.666,0.332,1.0],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[-0.204,1.602,1.0],[3.804,-0.402,1.0],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[3.804,-0.402,1.0],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"vec\",[2.337,0.332,1.0],[3.321,-0.16,1.0],\"#16a34a\",\"d\",4,-4],[\"vec\",[2.068,1.137,1.0],[3.052,0.645,1.0],\"#dc2626\",\"n\",6,10],[\"line\",[1.0,-1.0,1.0],[2.6,2.2,1.0],\"#64748b\",1.3,true],[\"pt\",[1.0,-1.0,1.0],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[1.8,0.6,1.0],\"M\",8,12],[\"pt\",[2.6,2.2,1.0],\"A′\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"vector normal\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 409 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m16sa4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m16sa4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m16sa4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m16sa4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='258.3,108.9 75.9,18.0 75.9,155.1 258.3,246.0' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='79.9' y='155.1' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π⊥</text><line x1='148.2' y1='134.5' x2='138.4' y2='129.6' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='138.4' y1='129.6' x2='157.3' y2='127.1' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='308.1' y1='113.0' x2='26.0' y2='151.0' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='32.0' y='151.0' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='129.3' y1='137.1' x2='60.0' y2='146.4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m16sa4d)'/><text x='64.0' y='142.4' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700'>d</text><line x1='186.7' y1='141.8' x2='117.4' y2='151.1' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m16sa4n)'/><text x='123.4' y='161.1' fill='#dc2626' font-weight='700'>n</text><line x1='108.6' y1='102.8' x2='225.6' y2='161.2' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.3' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><circle cx='108.6' cy='102.8' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='115.6' y='96.8' font-weight='700'>A</text><circle cx='167.1' cy='132.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='175.1' y='144.0' font-weight='700'>M</text><circle cx='225.6' cy='161.2' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='232.6' y='155.2' font-weight='700'>A′</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='14.6' y2='273.4' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='8.3' y='278.5' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='36.9' y2='272.4' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='38.5' y='277.3' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='254.5' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='253.1' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(157.0,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector normal</text></g><g transform='translate(249.9,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector director</text></g><g transform='translate(353.4,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>El simétrico de \\(A\\) respecto de \\(r\\) es \\(A'\\left(\\frac{13}{5},\\ \\frac{11}{5},\\ 1\\right)\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación: \\(\\overrightarrow{AM}=\\left(\\frac{4}{5},\\ \\frac{8}{5},\\ 0\\right)\\) es perpendicular a \\(\\vec d\\): \\(2\\cdot\\frac{4}{5}-\\frac{8}{5}+0\\cdot0=0\\) ✓.</i></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>El plano contiene a \\(\\vec d=(2,-1,0)\\) y a \\(\\overrightarrow{RA}=(0,-2,0)\\). Su normal:</p>\\[\\vec n=\\vec d\\times\\overrightarrow{RA}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\2&-1&0\\\\0&-2&0\\end{vmatrix}=(0,0,-4)\\parallel(0,0,1)\\]<p>El plano es de la forma \\(z+D=0\\) y contiene a \\(A(1,-1,1)\\): \\(1+D=0\\iff D=-1\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(z-1=0\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Tiene sentido: todos los puntos de \\(r\\) y el punto \\(A\\) tienen \\(z=1\\).</i></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
