  {
   "id": "matematicas-2016-septiembre-5",
   "n": 5,
   "num": 1,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) la función definida por \\(f(x)=x^2e^{-x^2}\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(0,75 p.) Estudia y determina las asíntotas de la gráfica de \\(f\\).",
     "(1,25 p.) Determina los intervalos de crecimiento y de decrecimiento de \\(f\\) y calcula sus extremos relativos (abscisas donde se obtienen y valores que se alcanzan).",
     "(0,5 p.) Esboza la gráfica de \\(f\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p><b>Asíntotas verticales:</b> no tiene, porque \\(f\\) es continua en \\(\\mathbb R\\).</p><p><b>Asíntotas horizontales:</b></p>\\[\\lim_{x\\to\\pm\\infty}x^2e^{-x^2}=\\lim_{x\\to\\pm\\infty}\\frac{x^2}{e^{x^2}}=\\left[\\frac\\infty\\infty\\right]\\overset{\\text{L'H}}=\\lim_{x\\to\\pm\\infty}\\frac{2x}{2xe^{x^2}}=\\lim_{x\\to\\pm\\infty}\\frac1{e^{x^2}}=0\\]<p>Hay asíntota horizontal \\(y=0\\) en \\(\\pm\\infty\\) y, por tanto, no hay oblicuas.</p><div class='res'>Asíntota horizontal \\(y=0\\) (en \\(\\pm\\infty\\)); no hay verticales ni oblicuas</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(f\\) es derivable en \\(\\mathbb R\\): no hay puntos «problemáticos». Estudiamos el signo de \\(f'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>.</p>\\[f'(x)=2xe^{-x^2}+x^2\\cdot(-2x)e^{-x^2}=2x(1-x^2)e^{-x^2}\\]\\[2x(1-x^2)e^{-x^2}=0\\iff\\boxed{x=-1},\\ \\boxed{x=0},\\ \\boxed{x=1}\\]<p>(\\(e^{-x^2}\\gt0\\) siempre.)</p><div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 356 108' width='100%' style='max-width:427px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H342' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M96 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='96' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>−1</text><path d='M178 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='178' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>0</text><path d='M260 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='260' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>1</text><text x='29.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M43.0 40L79.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M70.0 11L79.0 10L77.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='55.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(−2) &gt; 0</text><text x='111.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M125.0 10L161.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M152.0 39L161.0 40L159.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='137.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(−0,5) &lt; 0</text><text x='193.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M207.0 40L243.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M234.0 11L243.0 10L241.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='219.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(0,5) &gt; 0</text><text x='275.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M289.0 10L325.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M316.0 39L325.0 40L323.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='301.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(2) &lt; 0</text></svg></div><p>Luego \\(f\\) crece en \\((-\\infty,-1)\\) y \\((0,1)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\gt0\\), y decrece en \\((-1,0)\\) y \\((1,+\\infty)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\lt0\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si \\(f'\\gt0\\) en un intervalo, \\(f\\) crece en él; si \\(f'\\lt0\\), decrece.</i>. Alcanza máximos en \\(x=-1\\) y \\(x=1\\), de valor \\(f(\\pm1)=e^{-1}=\\frac1e\\), y un mínimo en \\(x=0\\) de valor \\(f(0)=0\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Hay un mínimo donde \\(f\\) pasa de decrecer a crecer y un máximo donde pasa de crecer a decrecer.</i>.</p><div class='res'>Crece en \\((-\\infty,-1)\\cup(0,1)\\); decrece en \\((-1,0)\\cup(1,+\\infty)\\). Máximos en \\(\\left(-1,\\frac1e\\right)\\) y \\(\\left(1,\\frac1e\\right)\\); mínimo en \\((0,0)\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado c",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(f\\) es par (simétrica respecto de \\(OY\\)), \\(f(x)\\ge0\\), vale 0 solo en \\(x=0\\) y tiende a 0 en \\(\\pm\\infty\\):</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 170' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polyline points='20.0,128.3 22.2,128.3 24.3,128.3 26.5,128.3 28.7,128.3 30.8,128.3 33.0,128.2 35.2,128.2 37.3,128.1 39.5,128.1 41.7,128.0 43.8,127.8 46.0,127.7 48.2,127.4 50.3,127.2 52.5,126.8 54.7,126.4 56.8,125.8 59.0,125.1 61.2,124.3 63.3,123.2 65.5,122.0 67.7,120.5 69.8,118.8 72.0,116.7 74.2,114.4 76.3,111.7 78.5,108.6 80.7,105.2 82.8,101.4 85.0,97.3 87.2,92.9 89.3,88.2 91.5,83.4 93.7,78.4 95.8,73.4 98.0,68.5 100.2,63.9 102.3,59.6 104.5,55.8 106.7,52.7 108.8,50.4 111.0,49.0 113.2,48.6 115.3,49.3 117.5,51.2 119.7,54.2 121.8,58.2 124.0,63.3 126.2,69.2 128.3,75.9 130.5,83.0 132.7,90.4 134.8,97.8 137.0,104.9 139.2,111.4 141.3,117.2 143.5,121.9 145.7,125.4 147.8,127.6 150.0,128.3 152.2,127.6 154.3,125.4 156.5,121.9 158.7,117.2 160.8,111.4 163.0,104.9 165.2,97.8 167.3,90.4 169.5,83.0 171.7,75.9 173.8,69.2 176.0,63.3 178.2,58.2 180.3,54.2 182.5,51.2 184.7,49.3 186.8,48.6 189.0,49.0 191.2,50.4 193.3,52.7 195.5,55.8 197.7,59.6 199.8,63.9 202.0,68.5 204.2,73.4 206.3,78.4 208.5,83.4 210.7,88.2 212.8,92.9 215.0,97.3 217.2,101.4 219.3,105.2 221.5,108.6 223.7,111.7 225.8,114.4 228.0,116.7 230.2,118.8 232.3,120.5 234.5,122.0 236.7,123.2 238.8,124.3 241.0,125.1 243.2,125.8 245.3,126.4 247.5,126.8 249.7,127.2 251.8,127.4 254.0,127.7 256.2,127.8 258.3,128.0 260.5,128.1 262.7,128.1 264.8,128.2 267.0,128.2 269.2,128.3 271.3,128.3 273.5,128.3 275.7,128.3 277.8,128.3 280.0,128.3' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='112.9' cy='48.6' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='82.9' y='42.6'>máx</text><circle cx='187.1' cy='48.6' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='191.1' y='42.6'>máx</text><circle cx='150.0' cy='128.3' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='154.0' y='142.3'>mín</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 128.3H294.0M150.0 164.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='38.6' y1='125.3' x2='38.6' y2='131.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='35.6' y='142.3' font-size='10'>-3</text><line x1='75.7' y1='125.3' x2='75.7' y2='131.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='72.7' y='142.3' font-size='10'>-2</text><line x1='112.9' y1='125.3' x2='112.9' y2='131.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='109.9' y='142.3' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='187.1' y1='125.3' x2='187.1' y2='131.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='184.1' y='142.3' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='224.3' y1='125.3' x2='224.3' y2='131.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='221.3' y='142.3' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='261.4' y1='125.3' x2='261.4' y2='131.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='258.4' y='142.3' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='147.0' y1='85.0' x2='153.0' y2='85.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='89.0' font-size='10'>0.2</text><line x1='147.0' y1='41.7' x2='153.0' y2='41.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='45.7' font-size='10'>0.4</text></svg></div></div>"
    }
   ],
