  {
   "id": "matematicas-2016-septiembre-7",
   "n": 7,
   "num": 3,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\-1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\\), \\(B=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\\) y \\(C=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&1\\\\-1&-1&-1\\\\0&0&0\\end{pmatrix}\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Calcula el rango de \\(AB^T+\\lambda I\\) según los valores de \\(\\lambda\\) (\\(B^T\\) es la matriz traspuesta de \\(B\\), \\(I\\) es la matriz identidad de orden 3).",
     "(1,5 p.) Calcula la matriz \\(X\\) que verifica \\(CX-X=2I\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[AB^T=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\-1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&1\\\\-1&-1&-1\\\\0&0&0\\end{pmatrix}\\qquad AB^T+\\lambda I=\\begin{pmatrix}1+\\lambda&1&1\\\\-1&\\lambda-1&-1\\\\0&0&\\lambda\\end{pmatrix}\\]<p>Calculo su determinante por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|AB^T+\\lambda I|=\\begin{vmatrix}1+\\lambda&1&1\\\\-1&\\lambda-1&-1\\\\0&0&\\lambda\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(\\lambda^{3} - \\lambda+0+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(0+0- \\lambda\\bigr)\\]\\[=\\lambda^3\\]<p><b>• Si </b>\\(\\lambda\\neq0\\)<b>:</b> el determinante no es nulo, rango 3.</p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(\\lambda=0\\)<b>:</b> la matriz es \\(AB^T\\), con la 2.ª fila opuesta a la 1.ª y la 3.ª nula: rango 1.</p><div class='res'>\\(\\operatorname{rg}(AB^T+\\lambda I)=3\\) si \\(\\lambda\\neq0\\); \\(=1\\) si \\(\\lambda=0\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Saco \\(X\\) factor común por la derecha<i class='n' data-t='err'>\\(CX-X=(C-I)X\\): hay que escribir \\(I\\), no 1, y \\(X\\) queda a la derecha.</i>:</p>\\[CX-X=2I\\iff(C-I)X=2I\\iff X=2(C-I)^{-1}\\]\\[C-I=\\begin{pmatrix}0&1&1\\\\-1&-2&-1\\\\0&0&-1\\end{pmatrix}\\]<p>(Es la matriz del apartado a) con \\(\\lambda=-1\\), porque \\(C=AB^T\\).) Su determinante, por la regla de Sarrus:</p>\\[|C-I|=\\begin{vmatrix}0&1&1\\\\-1&-2&-1\\\\0&0&-1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(0+0+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(0+0+1\\bigr)\\]\\[=-1\\neq0\\]\\[\\operatorname{Adj}(C-I)=\\begin{pmatrix}2&-1&0\\\\1&0&0\\\\1&-1&1\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow(C-I)^{-1}=\\frac1{-1}\\begin{pmatrix}2&1&1\\\\-1&0&-1\\\\0&0&1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-2&-1&-1\\\\1&0&1\\\\0&0&-1\\end{pmatrix}\\]<div class='res'>\\(X=2(C-I)^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}-4&-2&-2\\\\2&0&2\\\\0&0&-2\\end{pmatrix}\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
