  {
   "id": "matematicas-2016-septiembre-8",
   "n": 8,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Calcula la distancia entre las rectas dadas por las siguientes ecuaciones: \\(x=y=z\\) y \\(\\begin{cases}x=1+\\mu\\\\y=3+\\mu\\\\z=-\\mu\\end{cases}\\).",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(r\\equiv x=y=z\\) pasa por \\(O(0,0,0)\\) con \\(\\vec u=(1,1,1)\\); \\(s\\) pasa por \\(S(1,3,0)\\) con \\(\\vec v=(1,1,-1)\\). Los directores no son proporcionales. Con \\(\\overrightarrow{OS}=(1,3,0)\\) calculo el producto mixto por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i><i class='n' data-t='th'>Si el producto mixto es 0 las rectas se cortan; si no, se cruzan.</i>:</p>\\[[\\overrightarrow{OS},\\vec u,\\vec v]=\\begin{vmatrix}1&3&0\\\\1&1&1\\\\1&1&-1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(-1+3+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(0+1-3\\bigr)\\]\\[=4\\neq0\\]<p>Las rectas se cruzan. La distancia es la longitud del segmento \\(PQ\\) perpendicular a las dos (\\(P\\in r\\), \\(Q\\in s\\))<i class='n' data-t='why'>El segmento perpendicular común es el camino más corto entre dos rectas que se cruzan.</i>:</p>\\[P(t,t,t),\\quad Q(1+\\mu,\\,3+\\mu,\\,-\\mu),\\quad\\overrightarrow{PQ}=(1+\\mu-t,\\ 3+\\mu-t,\\ -\\mu-t)\\]\\[\\begin{cases}\\overrightarrow{PQ}\\cdot\\vec u=0\\\\\\overrightarrow{PQ}\\cdot\\vec v=0\\end{cases}\\iff\\begin{cases}4+\\mu-3t=0\\\\4+3\\mu-t=0\\end{cases}\\]<p>De la 2.ª, \\(t=4+3\\mu\\); en la 1.ª: \\(4+\\mu-12-9\\mu=0\\iff\\mu=-1\\), y \\(t=1\\). Entonces \\(P(1,1,1)\\) y \\(Q(0,2,1)\\):</p>\\[d(r,s)=|\\overrightarrow{PQ}|=|(-1,1,0)|=\\sqrt2\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":-45,\"el\":60,\"p\":[[\"line\",[-0.6,-0.6,-0.6],[2.2,2.2,2.2],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[2.2,2.2,2.2],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[-1.4,0.6,2.4],[1.6,3.6,-0.6],\"#16a34a\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[1.6,3.6,-0.6],\"s\",\"#16a34a\",6,0],[\"line\",[1,1,1],[0,2,1],\"#c2410c\",2.0,false],[\"line\",[1.173,1.173,1.173],[0.961,1.385,1.173],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[0.961,1.385,1.173],[0.788,1.212,1.0],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[0.173,2.173,0.827],[0.385,1.961,0.827],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[0.385,1.961,0.827],[0.212,1.788,1.0],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"pt\",[1,1,1],\"P\",8,12],[\"pt\",[0,2,1],\"Q\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"recta\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 245' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m16sb4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m16sb4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m16sb4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m16sb4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><line x1='26.0' y1='191.4' x2='278.0' y2='102.3' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='284.0' y='102.3' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='44.0' y1='18.0' x2='314.0' y2='113.5' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='320.0' y='113.5' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>s</text><line x1='170.0' y1='140.5' x2='170.0' y2='62.5' stroke='#c2410c' stroke-width='2.0'/><line x1='185.6' y1='135.0' x2='185.6' y2='118.4' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='185.6' y1='118.4' x2='170.0' y2='124.0' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='185.6' y1='68.1' x2='185.6' y2='84.6' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='185.6' y1='84.6' x2='170.0' y2='79.1' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><circle cx='170.0' cy='140.5' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='178.0' y='152.5' font-weight='700'>P</text><circle cx='170.0' cy='62.5' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='177.0' y='56.5' font-weight='700'>Q</text><line x1='24' y1='215' x2='35.3' y2='224.8' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='36.3' y='232.2' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='215' x2='35.3' y2='205.2' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='36.3' y='205.8' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='215' x2='24.0' y2='207.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='208.2' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,237)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,237)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector director</text></g><g transform='translate(210.0,237)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(d(r,s)=\\sqrt2\\approx1{,}414\\) unidades</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación con la fórmula: \\(\\vec u\\times\\vec v=(-2,2,0)\\) y \\(\\frac{|[\\overrightarrow{OS},\\vec u,\\vec v]|}{|\\vec u\\times\\vec v|}=\\frac4{\\sqrt8}=\\sqrt2\\) ✓.</i></div>"
